# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# DMK Mart ERP — environment template
# Copy this file to `.env` and adjust the values.
#   cp .env.example .env
# NEVER commit your real .env — it is gitignored on purpose.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── REQUIRED ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SQLite database file path.
# IMPORTANT: use an ABSOLUTE path — Prisma resolves relative
# paths against prisma/schema.prisma, not the project root.
#   Linux/macOS: file:/srv/dmk-mart-erp/db/custom.db
#   Windows:     file:C:/projects/dmk-mart-erp/db/custom.db
DATABASE_URL="file:/absolute/path/to/this/project/db/custom.db"

# ─── OPTIONAL (production standalone server) ────────────────────
# Port and bind address for `.next/standalone/server.js`.
# Defaults: PORT=3000, HOSTNAME=0.0.0.0
# PORT=3000
# HOSTNAME=0.0.0.0
# NODE_ENV=production

# ─── AI COPILOT (optional) ──────────────────────────────────────
# Two ways to configure the "DMK AI" copilot:
#
# 1) Environment variables (REQUIRED on Vercel, optional self-hosted):
#      AI_BASE_URL — any OpenAI-compatible endpoint, e.g.
#                   https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
#      AI_API_KEY  — that provider's API key
#      AI_MODEL    — optional model id, e.g. z-ai/glm-5.3-flash
# 2) A `.z-ai-config` JSON file (self-hosted only — files do not exist
#    on serverless). Searched in ./ , ~/ , and /etc/.
#    See `.z-ai-config.example` in the project root.
# Every other module works fully without the copilot.
#
# ─── VERCEL DEPLOYMENTS (optional) ──────────────────────────────
# CRON_SECRET — when set, GET /api/v1/recurring/generate (Vercel Cron
#   ping for recurring auto-post) requires `Authorization: Bearer <secret>`.
# See docs/deploy/vercel.md for the full walkthrough and
# docs/deploy/hostinger.md for the self-hosted (SQLite) path.
# CRON_SECRET=change-me-to-a-long-random-string
